# Google Drive sync uses a Desktop app OAuth client.
# Create one in Google Cloud Console, then copy its client secret into a local
# .env.local file (which is gitignored). Never commit the real value.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# The PWA (browser) flow additionally needs a Web application OAuth client so
# Google can redirect back to the app's own HTTPS URL. Register the app's URL
# (e.g. https://jennraeross.github.io/ProseCraft/app/) exactly, including the
# trailing slash, under Authorized redirect URIs, with the site origin under
# Authorized JavaScript origins. Until this is set, the PWA falls back to the
# desktop client, which Google will reject with redirect_uri_mismatch.
VITE_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=
